00:00:33.410 --> 00:00:37.829
Question 1 Reza zarabi (no avatar) asks Who
else will join the suicide squad this season

00:00:37.829 --> 00:00:41.609
or is it possible that amanda already recruited
some members before bronze tiger and deadshot.

00:00:41.609 --> 00:00:43.690
I think that we won’t see the squad again
till season 3.

00:00:43.690 --> 00:00:44.690
Meaning they’ll cast some new people.

00:00:44.690 --> 00:00:45.690
It’s possible they could cameo again during
the finale.

00:00:45.690 --> 00:00:46.690
But probably not.

00:00:46.690 --> 00:00:47.690
When they do come back I’d look to the other
B-level villains like Yo-yo, voltaic, black

00:00:47.690 --> 00:00:48.690
spider, maybe cheetah.

00:00:48.690 --> 00:00:51.039
Bet on them keeping the roster small though.

00:00:51.039 --> 00:00:52.680
They won’t cast too many new people.

00:00:52.680 --> 00:00:56.929
Question 2 Ian Resham (no avatar) asks do
you think the mirakuru derived from the lazarus

00:00:56.929 --> 00:01:00.219
pit seeing as to how they both share some
similar properties and side effects....do

00:01:00.219 --> 00:01:01.219
you think this might be revealed in the next
episode?

00:01:01.219 --> 00:01:06.400
No, I think the only reason the league is
in starling city is because of Merlin and

00:01:06.400 --> 00:01:07.400
the canary.

00:01:07.400 --> 00:01:09.700
The mirakuru is closer to DC’s version of
the marvel super soldier serum.

00:01:09.700 --> 00:01:10.740
People on it aren’t immortal.

00:01:10.740 --> 00:01:13.470
It’s just a less crazy version of Bane’s
venom.

00:01:13.470 --> 00:01:17.720
Question 3 Kennymiranda97 (no avatar) asks
Will they introduce slades daughter?

00:01:17.720 --> 00:01:18.900
You’re talking about Ravager.

00:01:18.900 --> 00:01:22.430
I can’t remember if they mentioned her during
season 1.

00:01:22.430 --> 00:01:24.560
Maybe briefly.

00:01:24.560 --> 00:01:26.860
But his son was just mentioned last week.

00:01:26.860 --> 00:01:30.000
