00:01:34.220 --> 00:01:47.270
Question 4 Adam Norpchen asks What other main
dc supers do you think 

00:01:47.270 --> 00:01:57.420
arrow with have? in the far and near future?﻿

00:01:57.420 --> 00:02:02.430
Question 5 - tekkenMaster87 asks Do your think
by the end of season 2 or the beginning of

00:02:02.430 --> 00:02:04.990
season 3 will we ever see ras al ghul?

00:02:04.990 --> 00:02:05.990
No major super heroes.

00:02:05.990 --> 00:02:10.500
But definitely some B and C Level heroes.

00:02:10.500 --> 00:02:13.109
The flash is the only other major super hero
we’ll see.

00:02:13.109 --> 00:02:18.049
And he’ll probably get a cameo or two this
fall when his tv show debuts.

00:02:18.049 --> 00:02:20.450
Just to build some excitement.

00:02:20.450 --> 00:02:24.780
Question 6 Isaias Mazariego (no avatar) asks
Do you think The Flash Tv Show is going to

00:02:24.780 --> 00:02:27.969
introduce different Flashes like Wally West
or Kid Flash to help Barry Allen using time

00:02:27.969 --> 00:02:28.969
travel via speed force?

00:02:28.969 --> 00:02:30.219
And any idea on when The Flash tv show will
start?

00:02:30.219 --> 00:02:31.219
Good question.

00:02:31.219 --> 00:02:32.239
They haven’t announced anything yet.

00:02:32.239 --> 00:02:33.660
But I don’t think they’ll do that in season
1.

00:02:33.660 --> 00:02:36.010
They’ll include references like when they
use names from the dc universe as street names

00:02:36.010 --> 00:02:37.010
in arrow.

00:02:37.010 --> 00:02:38.010
But if they ever do have another version of
the flash it would probably only be after

00:02:38.010 --> 00:02:39.010
the first couple of seasons.

00:02:39.010 --> 00:02:40.010
Season 1 will be all about developing grant
gustin’s character.

00:02:40.010 --> 00:02:41.010
Once he’s established, then there might
be room for some other flashes.

00:02:41.010 --> 00:02:42.010
It also depends on how close to the new 52
storyline they’ll stick.

00:02:42.010 --> 00:02:47.159
Question 7 Henry Lh asks Did you notice the
guy that left the bar just after Laurel did?

00:02:47.159 --> 00:02:48.969
Do you think that he was a member of the league
