00:02:56.469 --> 00:03:00.019
Question 8 Lizabeth90 (no avatar) asks Do
you think that slade will make Oliver relive

00:03:00.019 --> 00:03:03.359
the scenario of Shadows death only this time
with Laurel &amp; Sarah

00:03:03.359 --> 00:03:05.379
You mean like make him decide who to kill.

00:03:05.379 --> 00:03:06.379
I think it’s possible.

00:03:06.379 --> 00:03:10.180
There is a rumor that Sarah will die this
season and laurel will become black canary.

00:03:10.180 --> 00:03:11.810
So that could be how that happens.

00:03:11.810 --> 00:03:14.920
But I’m not expecting a laurel version black
canary anytime soon.

00:03:14.920 --> 00:03:16.769
Question 9 JasonCheeeseball asks Is Amanda
Waller good or bad?

00:03:16.769 --> 00:03:20.950
She was the one behind the planned destruction
of china's economy and is now hiring mercenaries

00:03:20.950 --> 00:03:23.230
to form the suicide squad?

00:03:23.230 --> 00:03:29.549
Yet she wanted to help diggle find lyla .

00:03:29.549 --> 00:03:32.849
Amanda Waller has always been an antagonist
to the justice league.

00:03:32.849 --> 00:03:33.870
She technically works for the government.

00:03:33.870 --> 00:03:37.790
So she will usually do whatever it takes to
fix a problem, including putting superheroes

00:03:37.790 --> 00:03:38.790
lives at risk.

00:03:38.790 --> 00:03:41.379
Which is kind of what the suicide squad is
all about.

00:03:41.379 --> 00:03:46.239
She’s like a shotgun spray shooting supers
at problems, hoping that they fix it or die

00:03:46.239 --> 00:03:47.239
trying.

00:03:47.239 --> 00:03:48.700
Question 10 Nam Harper asks Hi.

00:03:48.700 --> 00:03:53.629
Do you think that Thea could go Dark side
after learning who is her biological father?﻿

00:03:53.629 --> 00:03:57.799
I think that by the end of the season all
the characters will return to their normal

00:03:57.799 --> 00:03:58.799
relationships.

00:03:58.799 --> 00:04:02.519
But I do think that Merlin will be able to
twist Thea around a little until the league

00:04:02.519 --> 00:04:03.749
of assassins gets involved.

00:04:03.749 --> 00:04:09.030
Don’t be surprised if Thea’s life is put
at risk by the league as a way to lure merlin

00:04:09.030 --> 00:04:10.030
out.

00:04:10.030 --> 00:04:14.419
Bonus Question Mobbmaster asks do you think
Batman and Superman will be mentioned or make

00:04:14.419 --> 00:04:16.090
cameos in the show?

00:04:16.090 --> 00:04:20.390
Do you think The future Justice league movie
will include a new oliver queen, or Stephen

00:04:20.390 --> 00:04:21.940
Amell?﻿

00:04:21.940 --> 00:04:23.040
Definitely not on superman/batman.

00:04:23.040 --> 00:04:24.160
They’re just too big.

00:04:24.160 --> 00:04:25.280
It’s stephen amell’s show.

00:04:25.280 --> 00:04:29.480
There will never be an actor or character
more important than him on the show.

00:04:29.480 --> 00:04:35.010
And Stephen Amell himself actually said that
he was not approached at all about Justice

00:04:35.010 --> 00:04:36.010
League.

00:04:36.010 --> 00:04:39.240
It’s more likely that they just wouldn’t
use the green arrow character at all and it

00:04:39.240 --> 00:04:40.790
would just be batman, superman and wonderwoman.

00:04:40.790 --> 00:04:41.810
Think of justice league like a trinity storyline
if you’ve read the comic books.

00:04:41.810 --> 00:04:44.320
You can only cram so many big characters into
a movie before it turns into spiderman 3.

00:04:44.320 --> 00:04:47.420
Amell did say that he was totally down to
make an Arrow movie though.

00:04:47.420 --> 00:04:49.650
So it’s totally possible that they would
turn a two hour long episode into a tv movie

00:04:49.650 --> 00:04:50.650
after the show’s final season.

00:04:50.650 --> 00:04:52.700
But that probably won’t be for several years.

00:04:52.700 --> 00:04:56.110
Hint Hint, I’m expecting Arrow to get at
least 5 seasons, probably 7.

